<p class="text-center"><a style="text-align: center" target="_blank" href="https://www.weloveindies.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img title="WeLoveIndies" alt="WeLoveIndies" style="width:50%" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MjQyMDQxLnBuZw==/original/h%2FTPc2.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p>
<p class="text-center"><a style="text-align: center" target="_blank" href="https://syntystore.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin"><img title="Synty" alt="Synty" style="width:50%" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxOTY4OTg4LnBuZw==/original/f364qG.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p>
